<decompilertest>
<binaryimage arch="x86:LE:64:default:gcc">
<!--
    kuna-looprotate: a guarded do-while loop becomes a while loop
    (option looprotate).

    Source (clang -O2, x86-64):
      unsigned f3(unsigned n) { unsigned c = 0; while (n) { c += n &amp; 1; n &gt;&gt;= 1; } return c; }
      long f4(long *a, long n) { long s = 0; for (long i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) s ^= a[i]; return s; }

    clang tests the loop condition once in front of the loop and again at its
    bottom: if (!n) return 0; do {...} while (n);

    Stage: P8, ActionLoopRotate: the guard is the tail's condition on the
    values entering the loop (f3), or the loop counts by one from 0 to an
    exit at i + 1 == n behind a guard 0 &lt; n, so i + 1 != n is i + 1 &lt; n
    (f4); the header's MULTIEQUALs move to a new header that tests the
    condition, and the guard and the tail branch go. The for recovery then
    prints a for loop.

    Pass 1 (default) prints two for loops and no do-while; pass 2
    (looprotate off) the guards and the do-while loops.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x401000" readonly="true">

</bytechunk>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x401000" name="f1"/>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x401030" name="f2"/>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x401050" name="f3"/>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x401070" name="f4"/>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x401090" name="_start"/>
</binaryimage>
<script>
  <com>lo fu f3</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>lo fu f4</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>option looprotate off</com>
  <com>lo fu f3</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>lo fu f4</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>quit</com>
</script>
<stringmatch name="KUNA-LOOPROTATE #1: the bit-count loop tests at the top (default)" min="1" max="1">for \(; a0; a0 = a0 &gt;&gt; 1\)</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="KUNA-LOOPROTATE #2: the counting loop is a for loop up to n (default)" min="1" max="1">for \(\w+ = 0; \w+ &lt; a1; \w+ = \w+ \+ 1\)</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="KUNA-LOOPROTATE #3: looprotate off keeps both do-while loops" min="2" max="2">do \{</stringmatch>
</decompilertest>
